    phB1: 'Filipino maids', phB2: 'Enquire about a Filipino maid',
    bioE: 'Maid biodata Malaysia', bioH1: 'Featured helper profiles', bioH0: 'Ask for current helper biodata',
    bioP1: 'A selection of published profiles. Availability changes quickly, so please confirm the current status with our consultant.',
    bioP0: 'We publish profiles only with each candidate’s consent. Tell us what you need and our consultant will share suitable biodata directly.',
    bioEmptyH: 'Receive suitable biodata on WhatsApp', bioEmptyP: 'Share your household needs and preferred nationality. We will send profiles of candidates who match, and arrange interviews with those you shortlist.',
