    docs: [
      ['Identification', 'A clear copy of your MyKad (front and back), and in some cases your spouse’s.'],
      ['Proof of income', 'Recent salary slips, an EA form or bank statements. Business owners may provide business income documents.'],
      ['Proof of address', 'A recent utility bill or another document showing your home address.'],
      ['Household documents', 'Depending on your case, a marriage certificate or children’s birth certificates.'],
