    pkgE: 'Packages & service options', pkgH: 'Premium, Platinum and Diamond packages',
    pkgP: 'Package terms differ for Indonesian and Filipino helpers. Select a nationality to compare, then WhatsApp us for an accurate quotation.',
    arrE: 'Training, FOMEMA & arrival', arrH: 'What happens before your helper joins you', arrP: 'After approvals, there are a few important steps before handover. Here is what to expect.',
